{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51140","headline":"过杨玄感墓 · 李百药","name":"过杨玄感墓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（《唐书》曰：天后西幸京师，路经杨玄感墓，上诵李百药《过玄感墓诗》云云，叹曰：「百药唯解缀文，不识大义。\n」○今按：两《唐书·则天纪》、《百药传》均不载。\n）剑有万人敌，文爲一代英。\n除昏志不遂，僭乱道难平。\n（《太平御览》五五八《礼仪部》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李百药","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51140.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51140","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}